        "tree_id": "066ad58dbfbfd5d84aad38572198094dc9e7a494",
        "message": "feat(daemon,web): document deliverables build route + interactive spreadsheet viewer\n\nux-gap-roadmap-01 + 12. Deliverables: versioned DeckSpec/DocSpec/WorkbookSpec\ncontracts with bounded parsing; daemon builders via pptxgenjs/docx/exceljs\nwriting real .pptx/.docx/.xlsx files into the workspace deliverables\ndirectory through POST /deliverables/build. Spreadsheet viewer: sync\nsheet-name extraction from the workbook zip for the preview envelope,\na workspace-bound windowed /previews/spreadsheet route (formulas are\nserved for reference and never evaluated), and a web SpreadsheetGrid with\nsheet tabs, sticky headers, cell selection, formula bar and load-more\nwindowing so large workbooks never load whole.\n\nUnit tests: builder round-trips (pptx zip structure + speaker notes,\ndocx content, xlsx re-read via exceljs), spec validation, window\nclamping, extraction windows, API routes incl. workspace-bound escape\nrejection. Playwright spec with screenshot evidence covers sheet tab\nswitching, cell selection and the formula bar.",
